<title>USA: Dodge City feeder steer prices steady-up $4 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Dodge City feeder steer prices steady-up $4 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers 300-650 lbs were steady to $2.00 per cwt higher, few instances $3.00-$4.00 higher, compared with last week, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder steers 650-700 lbs in a limited test steady, 750-1000 lbs $2.00-$3.00 higher. Feeder heifers 650-900 lbs $1.00-$2.00 higher.</p>
<p>Trade very active, demand very good. Receipts 57 percent 600 lbs and over; 39 percent 600 lbs and under; 04 percent cows and bulls with 250 early.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - (Figures in parentheses are weighted average prices) Medium and Large 1 600-650 lbs 78.00-85.50 (80.73); 650-700 lbs 76.50-79.75 (77.85); 700-750 lbs 72.50-74.25 (73.63); 750-800 lbs 69.20-76.40 (72.63); 800-850 lbs 69.00-74.00 (72.09); 850-900 lbs 67.00- 68.75 (67.32); 26 head 26 head 906 lbs 69.35; 53 head 973 lbs 66.10.Full and/or fleshy 500-550 lbs 78.00-80.00 (79.21); 20 head 586 lbs 79.50; 650- 700 lbs 66.50-72.00 (70.54); 70 head 787 lbs 67.35; 60 head 841 lbs 67.75. Steers and bulls 250-300 lbs 88.00-92.00 (89.54); 400-425 lbs 87.00-89.00 (87.56); 450-500 lbs 86.00-86.50 (86.19). Medium and Large 1-2 600-650 lbs 65.50-67.00 (66.58); 650-700 lbs 73.00-74.75 (72.59); 700-750 lbs 63.00-70.00 (67.52); 38 head 766 lbs 66.75. Medium and Large 2-3 7 head 685 lbs 60.50. Large 2 Holsteins - 12 head 697 lbs 59.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers Medium and Large 1 550-600 lbs 74.00-84.00 (76.45), 63 head Replacement 565 lbs 84.50; 600-650 lbs 71.00-75.50 (72.84); 650-800 lbs 68.50-71.50 (70.42), 41 head Replacement 673 lbs 73.75; 700-750 lbs 67.50-70.00 (68.94); 750-800 lbs 66.50-70.25 (68.06); 800-850 lbs 66.00-67.75 (66.45); 850-900 lbs 64.50-66.75 (65.89); 22 head 905 lbs 65.00. Full and/or fleshy 39 head 533 lbs 66.00; 21 head 703 lbs 52.25; 750-800 lbs 65.50-65.75 (65.65). Medium and Large 1-2 600-650 lbs 67.00-68.00 (67.40); 650-700 lbs 64.00-67.00 (66.38); 700-750 lbs 65.00-66.25 (65.86); 750-800 lbs 64.00-65.00 (64.72). Medium 1 650-700 lbs 63.75-67.00 (65.42); 99 head 707 lbs 65.00. Receipts - 6,414   Last Week - 4,487   Last Year - 3,393</p>
